info at ./checker/request_required_property_not_read_only_31_revision.yaml, in API POST /api/v1.0/groups the request required property `id` became not read-only [request-required-property-became-not-read-only-in-openapi-31]. In OpenAPI 3.1 and later, required applies to a read-only property in requests too, so clients already send it and this change cannot invalidate a request.


